+// gx_fifo_parse.inc - the raw-FIFO (gather pipe) parser of gx_fifo.cpp, compiled twice there: over
+// g_hleGxState on the main thread, and (GXF4, WIICOMPILED_GXF_STREAM=1, Switch) over the GXF stream
